WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.700
I want to continue in Volume 2, beginning in September the 21st, 1899.

2
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:16.940
Louisa has differences with Lady Obedience.

3
00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:22.000
Yet who would have said it, Louisa said, "In spite of the fact that the wrong is hers,

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.540
and that she does not give me the capacity to manifest it, misobedience took offense

5
00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:30.840
and began to act like a cruel tyrant.

6
00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:36.580
And she reached such cruelty as to take the sight of my loving good away from me, my soul,

7
00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:38.540
and only comfort.

8
00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:44.500
It really shows that sometimes she also behaves like a little girl, when she has a whim for

9
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:45.500
something.

10
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:49.280
If she doesn't get it with good manners, she defens the house with screams and with

11
00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:53.380
crying to the point that one is forced to content her.

12
00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:58.340
There are no reasons, there's no way in the middle ground to persuade her.

13
00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:01.540
So that's the way Lady Obedience does.

14
00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:03.520
"Brava," she says.

15
00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:06.980
I would not have thought you were like this.

16
00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:11.940
Since she wants to get her own way, she wants me even stammering to write about charity.

17
00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:20.000
Now, here's Louisa reacting badly to being asked to write about this great, great thing

18
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.420
called charity.

19
00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:23.820
She feels she's not able to do it.

20
00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:26.180
And that's why she's reacting.

21
00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:33.260
And all she's got to do is step out and walk on water and let Jesus speak through her.

22
00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:34.820
But she's really struggling.

23
00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:39.620
"Oh, holy God, you yourself make her a little bit more reasonable because it really shows

24
00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:42.420
