45
00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:29.100
So I resume my poor communication, she says.

46
00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:34.580
"While my mind was occupied with the things already said, I was thinking to myself, what

47
00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:36.620
