48
00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:43.680
If I myself did not practice what I write, this writing would certainly be my condemnation.

49
00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:49.340
While I was thinking of this, blessed Jesus came and told me, this writing will serve

50
00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:56.060
