73
00:05:52.660 --> 00:06:00.140
But she's still having problems with writing in September 22, 1899.

74
00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:04.540
Louisa says, "I feel a nail stuck in my heart because of the word spoken yesterday by my

75
00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:06.300
