92
00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:15.380
I feel I still don't understand what virtue and perfection is, but obedience wants so,

93
00:07:15.380 --> 00:07:19.460
and it is better to croak than having to deal with her."

94
00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:22.380
