95
00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:27.660
If one does as she says she assumes the appearance of a lady and caresses you like a most faithful

96
00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:33.060
friend, even more she promises you all the goods that are in heaven and on earth.

97
00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:37.340
