102
00:07:55.940 --> 00:08:01.740
Notice the way she shifts from male to female images there quite easily.

103
00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:07.300
Then while Jesus was saying these words to me, I told him, "My good Jesus, what good

104
00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:11.460
is it for my soul to have so many graces?

105
00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:17.500
If then they embit her my whole life, especially because of the hours of your privation.

106
00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:26.660
In fact, understanding who you are and of whom I am being deprived, it is a continuous

107
00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:28.860
martyrdom for me.

108
00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:36.380
