114
00:09:00.380 --> 00:09:03.060
In other words, you need balance in the spiritual life.

115
00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:07.340
As you need balance in all life, we need night to balance the day.

116
00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:09.520
We need darkness to balance the light.

117
00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:15.820
We need mourning to balance the evening and so on and so on.

118
00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:21.180
But if the person always tasted bitterness without knowing what the sweet is and by not

